<!doctype html><html lang="de"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Kundenfreigabe öffnen</title><style>body{font:16px system-ui;max-width:540px;margin:3rem auto;padding:0 1rem;color:#1a3442}label{display:block;margin:1rem 0}input{display:block;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;padding:.7rem;margin:.5rem 0}button{padding:.7rem 1rem;cursor:pointer}.error{color:#a32020}</style></head><body><h1>Kundenfreigabe öffnen</h1><p>Bitte das separat erhaltene Passwort eingeben.</p><% if(error){ %><p class="error" role="alert"><%= error %></p><% } %><form method="post" action="/cad-approval/<%= token %>/unlock"><label>Passwort<input type="password" name="password" minlength="12" maxlength="128" autocomplete="current-password" required></label><button type="submit">Zeichnung öffnen</button></form></body></html>
